OL,3,GNEWSATunnel to close while landslip
OL,4,Amonitors installed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road tunnel is to close for nearly a
OL,7,Fmonth to allow landslip monitoring
OL,8,Fequipment to be installed as part of
OL,9,Fongoing safety works.
OL,11,FSurveys and investigations have been
OL,12,Fcontinuing at Beaminster tunnel in
OL,13,FDorset after part of the embankment
OL,14,Fcollapsed in February.
OL,16,FDorset Council said work would take
OL,17,Fplace from Monday 9 November until 4
OL,18,FDecember, and had been timed to avoid
OL,19,Fthe wet winter months when there was an
OL,20,Fincreased risk of ground movement.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
